  491 03f3 db 6c                 BIRR,R3   BLOA
  492 03f5 0c 04 2c       CLOA   LODA,R0   BCC
  493 03f8 9c 00 1d              BCFA,Z    EBUG
  494 03fb 1f 03 b5              BCTA,UN   LOAD
